<title>USA: Acordia names Witthun as chief executive.</title>
<headline>Acordia names Witthun as chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acordia Inc said Wednesday its board of directors appointed Frank Witthun as chief executive officer of the insurance brokerage firm.</p>
<p>Witthun replaces L. Ben Lytle, who will continue to serve as chairman of the board.  </p>
<p>Witthun previously served as president and chief operating officer of Acordia. The company said, however, it is not searching for a replacement for those positions.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
